  "duration": 49.679,
  "lines": [
    {
      "key": "hook",
      "text": "Real or fake? Here's why the fake might actually win.",
      "start": 0.35,
      "end": 3.282
    },
    {
      "key": "price",
      "text": "A designer bag can cost three thousand dollars. A good replica? About a hundred.",
      "start": 3.832,
      "end": 8.451
    },
    {
      "key": "closet",
      "text": "But a bag you're scared to use just sits in the closet.",
      "start": 9.001,
      "end": 11.385
    },
    {
      "key": "wear",
      "text": "Think cost per wear. Carry the replica every day for a year, and it's less than thirty cents a wear.",
      "start": 11.885,
      "end": 17.182
    },
    {
      "key": "fearless",
      "text": "Concerts. Airports. Rainy days. It goes everywhere, with zero stress.",
      "start": 17.732,
      "end": 21.862
    },
    {
      "key": "test",
      "text": "It's also the cheapest way to test a style. Try the look for a hundred, before you ever commit three thousand.",
      "start": 22.412,
      "end": 28.524
    },
    {
      "key": "lost",
      "text": "And if it's stolen, or lost on a trip? You're out a hundred dollars, not a month's pay.",
      "start": 29.074,
      "end": 33.366
    },
    {
      "key": "resale",
      "text": "People call designer bags an investment. But most resell for less than you paid.",
      "start": 33.916,
      "end": 38.557
    },
    {
      "key": "seen",
      "text": "And at the end of the day, nobody sees the receipt. They just see how you carry it.",
      "start": 39.107,
      "end": 43.196
    },
    {
      "key": "end",
      "text": "So keep the look, and keep the money. Real or fake: which would you pick?",
      "start": 43.796,
      "end": 47.479
    }
  ],
